  "details": "<p><span>Luhsu</span>\u00a0is mentioned together with <span>Anduarsalla,\u00a0</span>Anmurru, Kiaka, and Pur\u1e6dir in royal inscriptions of Sargon II. It has been suggested that\u00a0<span>Luhsu is situated between Purteyrlu (<span>Pur\u1e6dir</span>) and Nemerli (<span>Anmurru</span>).</span></p>",
  "review_state": "published",
